'''Ocean''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by purchasing it individually from the [[Ocean Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux or from the [[Ocean Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Summer Event 2023]]. It is now only available through trading since the event has ended.

==Appearance ==
The body of this gun is colored with blue, pastel blue and white. It represents the ocean, hence its name. The frame of the gun seems to be a linen colored with shell like design, connecting with the body of the gun. 

==Trivia == 
* It has a partner knife under the name [[Waves]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Ocean Set|Ocean Set]].
* This and its partner knife were the first summer themed godlies to be added to the game, the others being [[Pearl]], [[Pearlshine]], [[Watergun]], and [[Chroma Watergun]].
*This gun was released on July 4th, 2023, during the [[Summer Event 2023]].
* This and its partner knife are the sixth gamepass weapons where you had the option to buy it as part of a bundle or separately, the others being [[Rainbow (Godly)|Rainbow]], [[Rainbow Gun (Godly)|Rainbow Gun]], [[Sakura]], [[Blossom]], [[Phantom]], [[Spectre]], [[Plasmablade]], [[Plasmabeam]], [[Iceflake]], [[Icebeam]], [[Pearl]] and [[Pearlshine]].
* This gun and its partner knife were replaced by [[Darksword]] and [[Darkshot]].

